# power-num-com

Each function prints the code of one practical (1-16).

```python
import power_num_com as p

p.practical1()
p.practical15()
p.practical2()        # BFS, DFS and Dijkstra
p.practical2_bfs()    # one file only (also _dfs, _dijkstra)
p.practical4_hessian()  # also _gradient, _jacobian
```
